# supercronic reads /home/agent/.crontab (baked s6 service). Env (PYTHONPATH,
# secrets) is inherited from the agent container. Surge gate every 15m; digest daily 08:00.
*/15 * * * * /opt/alert-agent-bin/surge-gate
0 8 * * * /opt/alert-agent-bin/digest
# 6-hourly Claude-credential expiry check: warns Telegram at <=7/3/1 days (once per
# warning-day per tier, de-duped in the handler) + emits a heartbeat every run watched by a Grafana dead-man rule (frank#cred-expiry-alert).
0 3,9,15,21 * * * /opt/alert-agent-bin/cred-expiry-check
